{"product":{"id":9728655294689,"title":"WOODSMAN 108","body_html":"<p>The Woodsman 108 is our soft-snow directional workhorse: a 108mm all-mountain platform built to charge through chop and stay stable at speed in demanding terrain.</p>\n<p>For 26/27, the Woodsman 108 receives an updated flex profile that is stiffer underfoot and through the forebody. This adds torsional stiffness for better edge hold and more stability at speed. Signature Rocker helps the ski float and smear through soft snow, while camber underfoot keeps the wide platform driving hard when conditions get cut up. The Bi-Radius Sidecut keeps it maneuverable in tight terrain, while the longer tail radius holds a stable line through high-speed runouts. A directional mount and supportive tail make it a ski for fast, committed skiers who need a tool up to the task. This is the Woodsman for skiers in soft-snow regions who want a wider everyday ski with real drive.</p>\n<p>Every Woodsman 108 is built with our custom 2800 hybrid fiberglass/carbon composite, a 100% bamboo core, full-length UHMW sidewalls, and the thickest bases and edges in skiing. The result is a stable, powerful, and durable all-mountain ski designed to take a beating.</p>","vendor":"ON3P","product_type":"Skis","created_at":"2026-09-15T20:17:44-07:00","handle":"woodsman-108","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:41-07:00","published_at":"2026-09-20T14:30:55-07:00","template_suffix":"ski","published_scope":"global","tags":"26.27, Stock Ski, Woodsman","variants":[{"id":49128490598625,"product_id":9728655294689,"title":"161cm","price":"899.00","sku":"27ON3PWD108161","position":1,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"161cm","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-09-15T20:17:44-07:00","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:41-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0,"weight_unit":"lb","inventory_quantity":4,"old_inventory_quantity":